sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant CDN as Cache
  participant S as Server
  U->>CDN: GET /deals (fresh)
  CDN-->>U: cached HTML
  Note over CDN: revalidate window passes
  U->>CDN: GET /deals (stale)
  CDN-->>U: stale HTML (fast)
  CDN->>S: regenerate in background
  S-->>CDN: new HTML